{%- comment -%}
Minimal homepage for the option B demo theme. The demo covers two templates
(Curated Collection product page, subscription-builder quiz); the rest of the
site is not ported yet, so the homepage is a plain index of what exists.
Also satisfies Shopify's requirement that a publishable theme has an index
template.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section style="min-height:70vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--white,#fbf9ee);">
  <div style="text-align:center;padding:40px 24px;">
    <img src="{{ 'thehyun.svg' | asset_url }}" width="160" alt="THE HYUN" style="margin-bottom:40px;"/>
    <div style="font-family:var(--kr,sans-serif);font-weight:300;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:28px;color:var(--black,#212222);">
      Option B demo — two templates ported off Webflow
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;align-items:center;">
      <a href="/products/curated-collection" class="primary-button w-button">Curated Collection (product page)</a>
      <a href="/pages/subscription-builder?view=subscription-builder" class="primary-button tertiarybtn w-button">Subscription Builder (quiz)</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
